  "description": "ICU-based analysis, a port of Lucene's analysis/icu module: ICUTokenizer (UAX #29 word segmentation per script, with dictionary segmentation for Thai, Lao, Khmer, Myanmar and Chinese/Japanese, script and emoji token types), ICUNormalizer2Filter and ICUNormalizer2CharFilter (Unicode normalization), ICUFoldingFilter (UTR #30 folding), ICUTransformFilter (ICU transforms: script conversion, Latin-ASCII, custom rules), and ICU collation keys for locale-sensitive sorting and ranges (ICUCollationKeyAnalyzer, ICUCollationDocValuesField). Results match Java Lucene with ICU4J 79.1. Note: depends on LuceneSharp.Icu, a separately licensed package (Unicode-3.0) with the ICU code and data.",
